{"version":1,"content":"<p>在美國總統特朗普的持續施壓和幕後運作下，英偉達董事會罕見地在短短一周內改變立場，一致投票恢復黃仁勳的行政總裁、總裁及董事會董事職務。此舉距離董事會此前明確表示「無意讓黃仁勳重返CEO職位」僅過去數天，令市場、分析師和政界人士普遍感到震驚。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587746.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.207940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"eeb1ce2f22bc5c73f3df37cb1eaf65474c6e94ad0f88ed4fe4b0e1f4ffb1dd1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}